<title>MOROCCO: Morocco buys 10,000T of French soft wheat-official.</title>
<headline>Morocco buys 10,000T of French soft wheat-official.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco purchased 10,000 tonnes of French soft wheat at $173 per tonne C&amp;F for delivery on December 1-10, 1996, said an official at the Office Interprofessionnel des Cereales et Legumineuses (ONICL).</p>
<p>He said the purchase was made on Friday and the French government export agency COFACE guranteed the credit for the quantities.</p>
<p>ONICL said the lot will be delivered at the northern port of Nador.</p>
<p>--Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
